<span class=3D"c1"># SCALAR TYPES #</span>
<span class=3D"c1">################</span>

<span class=3D"c1"># Our root object (which continues for the entire docume=
nt) will be a map,</span>
<span class=3D"c1"># which is equivalent to a dictionary, hash or object in=
